{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-residences-difc-zabeel-distric","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1399,"crm_id":"7426","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"The Residences","slug":"the-residences-difc-zabeel-distric","display_address":"Zabeel District","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"DIFC","price":2600000,"display_price":"2.6M","lattitude":25.290574735292,"longitude":55.306528403158,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Residences <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-difc/\">DIFC Zabeel District</a> marks the debut residential chapter within DIFC’s newest urban destination, developed by DIFC Developments. Comprising two architecturally refined towers, the project features 463 residences, including <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments alongside exclusive 3 and 4-bedroom duplex penthouses</strong>, complemented by curated retail experiences.</p><p>Designed around hospitality-inspired living, The Residences in DIFC Zabeel District offers a refined lifestyle enriched by resort-style amenities such as a signature pool, clubhouse, family-focused leisure zones, and dedicated sports courts. Located within a transformative district, the development presents strong potential for long-term capital appreciation, supported by an accessible 5% down payment structure.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_61157a8a82.jpg","hash":"Feature_61157a8a82","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_9fd1ef3a57.jpg","hash":"Banner_9fd1ef3a57","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_1