d Residential Collection – Two signature towers hosting just 463 residences, ensuring exclusivity within a mixed-use master destination.</li><li>Diverse Residence Mix – Thoughtfully planned apartments and duplex penthouses designed for modern urban lifestyles and long-term ownership.</li><li>Hospitality-Inspired Amenities – Resort-style pools, clubhouse facilities, and curated social spaces elevate everyday residential living.</li><li>Integrated Retail Environment – Premium retail and destination F&amp;B seamlessly embedded into the district’s walkable urban fabric.</li><li>Developer-Led Vision – Delivered by DIFC Developments, reinforcing long-term value through master-planned execution and legacy positioning.</li><li>Flexible Payment Structure – A structured 70/30 plan anchored by a low 5% down payment supports both end-users and investors.</li><li>High Capital Appreciation Outlook – Limited supply within a future-forward DIFC expansion zone enhances long-term growth potential.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2032,"cta":{"id":2862,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_1daceb522a.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_1daceb522a","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Connected Living at the Heart of DIFC’s Next Evolution","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Located just minutes from Sheikh Zayed Road (E11), The Residences in DIFC Zabeel District enjoys direct access to Dubai’s primary commercial, cultural, and lifestyle corridors. The development sits within a highly connected urban zone, linking residents effortlessly to business districts, leisure destinations, and iconic city landmarks.</p><ul><li>2 Minutes – Zabeel Palace</li><li>8 Minutes – Dubai Design District</li><li>9 Minutes –